## Search notes (why self-excluded)

- BenchLM has no profile for this SKU: `benchlm.ai/models/qwen3-8-flash`, `qwen3.8-flash`, `qwen-3.8-flash` and `qwen3.8-flash-preview` all return HTTP 404.
- llm-stats.com/models/qwen3.8-flash lists the model and a composite "LLM Stats Score" rank (#36) but renders its benchmark table client-side; no primary figure is extractable from the served HTML.
- benchmarklist.com has a page for `qwen-qwen3.8-flash-next` (a different SKU) but not for `qwen3.8-flash`.
- The only published numbers near this name belong to `Qwen3.8-Flash-Next` (262K context, 125B/6B MoE) — a separate tracked model with a separate folder. Citing them here would conflate two SKUs, so they were deliberately not transferred.
- Resolution: the model card facts above (context, price, modalities, release) are vendor-catalog verified; the benchmark columns stay empty until Alibaba publishes a Qwen3.8-Flash scorecard or an independent tracker profiles the exact SKU.

